# NVCCZ backend agent playbook

Before inventing a workflow for backend feature work, follow:

**`docs/nvccz-backend-agent-playbook.md`**

That doc covers: delivery pipeline (code → migrate script → docs → 3 DBs → UAT → FE handoff), no Prisma Migrate, FE contract conventions, UAT self-sufficiency, and an FP&A module map (Builder vs Model Planning vs Budgeting).

Encoded in sibling rules (same habits):

- `nvccz-database-no-prisma-migrate.mdc`
- `nvccz-fpa-deliver-pipeline.mdc`
- `nvccz-uat-scripts-self-sufficient.mdc`

Do not commit, push, or VPS-deploy unless the user explicitly asks in that turn.
